# Configuration

`.mydiff.toml` in the working directory is loaded automatically.

```console
$ mydiff config paths
? success
not found  /nonexistent/mydiff-tests/mydiff/config.toml
   loaded  .mydiff.toml

$ mydiff config show
? success
whitespace = "trailing"
ignore_case = false
ignore_blank_lines = false
ignore_line_endings = true
ignore = []
only = []
mask = []
context = 3
modify_threshold = 0.5
algorithm = "myers"
include = []
exclude = []
key_columns = []
ignore_paths = []

```

Profiles add to the defaults; CLI flags override both.

```console
$ mydiff -f summary run1.log run2.log
? 1
run1.log vs run2.log: 0 removed, 0 added, 2 modified (0 equal)

$ mydiff -f summary --profile logs run1.log run2.log
run1.log vs run2.log: identical (1 equal, 2 ignored)

$ mydiff -f summary --no-config --profile logs run1.log run2.log
? 2
mydiff: error: invalid configuration: profile `logs` not found (known: none)

```
